      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAKE A PANTHER (2) is having his first start around this track. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 2.75 lengths (17.27) at Healesville. Has ability and is a key runner. CHAPPY'S HIKARI (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Geelong following on from a third place finish (24.17) at Bendigo the start prior. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts. Cannot be taken lightly. RATTLE AND HUM (3) clocked a strong 22.76 when filling a minor placing over 400m at Warragul last start. Should be in this for a long way. AUTUMN POPPY (7) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
